      "text": "86,107.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 311 by 7 (ones place of 277):**\n   - 7 \u00d7 1 = 7\n   - 7 \u00d7 1 = 7\n   - 7 \u00d7 3 = 21\n   - Write down 217.\n\n2. **Multiply 311 by 70 (tens place of 277):**\n   - 70 \u00d7 1 = 70\n   - 70 \u00d7 1 = 70\n   - 70 \u00d7 3 = 210\n   - Write down 21,770.\n\n3. **Multiply 311 by 200 (hundreds place of 277):**\n   - 200 \u00d7 1 = 200\n   - 200 \u00d7 1 = 200\n   - 200 \u00d7 3 = 600\n   - Write down 62,200.\n\n4. **Add all the partial products:**\n   - 217 + 21,770 + 62,200 = 84,187.\n\n**Final Answer:**\nThe product of 311 and 277 is \\boxed{84187}.",
