      "text": "43,836.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 186 by 6 (ones place of 236):**\n   - 6 \u00d7 6 = 36. Write down 6 and carry over 3.\n   - 6 \u00d7 8 = 48 + 3 (carry) = 51. Write down 1 and carry over 5.\n   - 6 \u00d7 1 = 6 + 5 (carry) = 11. Write down 11.\n   - **Partial Product:** 1,116\n\n2. **Multiply 186 by 30 (tens place of 236):**\n   - 30 \u00d7 6 = 180. Write down 0 and carry over 18.\n   - 30 \u00d7 8 = 240 + 18 (carry) = 258. Write down 8 and carry over 25.\n   - 30 \u00d7 1 = 30 + 25 (carry) = 55. Write down 55.\n   - **Partial Product:** 5,580\n\n3. **Multiply 186 by 200 (hundreds place of 236):**\n   - 200 \u00d7 6 = 1,200. Write down 00 and carry over 12.\n   - 200 \u00d7 8 = 1,600 + 12 (carry) = 1,612. Write down 12 and carry over 161.\n   - 200 \u00d7 1 = 200 + 161 (carry) = 361. Write down 361.\n   - **Partial Product:** 37,200\n\n4. **Add all partial products together:**\n   - 1,116 + 5,580 = 6,696\n   - 6,696 + 37,200 = 43,896\n\n**Final Answer:** 43,896\n\n\\boxed{43896}",
