      "text": "175,604.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 427 by 2 (ones place of 412):**\n   - 427 \u00d7 2 = 854\n\n2. **Multiply 427 by 10 (tens place of 412):**\n   - 427 \u00d7 10 = 4,270\n\n3. **Multiply 427 by 400 (hundreds place of 412):**\n   - 427 \u00d7 400 = 170,800\n\n4. **Add all the partial products together:**\n   - 854 + 4,270 + 170,800 = 175,604\n\n**Final Answer:**\nThe product of 427 and 412 is \\boxed{175604}.",
