      "index": 0,
      "text": "82,500.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Write the numbers vertically aligned by place value:**\n   \n   ```\n     750\n   \u00d7 110\n   ```\n\n2. **Multiply 750 by 0 (ones place of 110):**\n   \n   ```\n     750\n   \u00d7  10\n   -------\n      000\n   ```\n\n3. **Multiply 750 by 1 (tens place of 110), shifted one position to the left:**\n   \n   ```\n     750\n   \u00d7  10\n   -------\n     7500\n   ```\n\n4. **Multiply 750 by 1 (hundreds place of 110), shifted two positions to the left:**\n   \n   ```\n     750\n   \u00d7 100\n   -------\n    75000\n   ```\n\n5. **Add all the partial products together:**\n   \n   ```\n     000\n   +7500\n   +75000\n   -------\n    82500\n   ```\n\n6. **Final Answer:**\n   \n   The product of 750 and 110 is **82,500**.\n\n\\boxed{82500}",
