      "text": "58,580.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Set Up the Multiplication:**\n   ```\n     202\n   \u00d7 290\n   ```\n\n2. **Multiply 202 by 0 (units place of 290):**\n   ```\n     202\n   \u00d7  0\n   ----\n     000\n   ```\n\n3. **Multiply 202 by 90 (tens place of 290):**\n   - Multiply 202 by 9:\n     ```\n       202\n     \u00d7  9\n     ----\n     1818\n     ```\n   - Since 9 is in the tens place, shift one position to the left:\n     ```\n     18180\n     ```\n\n4. **Multiply 202 by 200 (hundreds place of 290):**\n   - Multiply 202 by 2:\n     ```\n       202\n     \u00d7  2\n     ----\n     404\n     ```\n   - Since 2 is in the hundreds place, shift two positions to the left:\n     ```\n     40400\n     ```\n\n5. **Add All Partial Products:**\n   ```\n     000\n   +18180\n   +40400\n   -------\n    58580\n   ```\n\n6. **Final Answer:**\n   \\[\n   202 \\times 290 = \\boxed{58,\\!580}\n   \\]",
