      "text": "74,066.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 178 by 7 (ones place of 417):**\n   - 8 \u00d7 7 = 56. Write down 6 and carry over 5.\n   - 7 \u00d7 7 = 49, plus the carried 5 equals 54. Write down 4 and carry over 5.\n   - 1 \u00d7 7 = 7, plus the carried 5 equals 12. Write down 12.\n   - **Partial Product:** 1,246\n\n2. **Multiply 178 by 10 (tens place of 417):**\n   - This is equivalent to multiplying by 1 and then adding a zero.\n   - **Partial Product:** 1,780\n\n3. **Multiply 178 by 400 (hundreds place of 417):**\n   - This is equivalent to multiplying by 4 and then adding two zeros.\n   - **Partial Product:** 71,200\n\n4. **Add all partial products together:**\n   - 1,246 + 1,780 = 3,026\n   - 3,026 + 71,200 = 74,226\n\n**Final Answer:**\nThe product of 178 and 417 is \\boxed{74226}.",
