      "text": "603,140.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 820 by 7 (ones place of 737):**\n   - 820 \u00d7 7 = 5,740\n\n2. **Multiply 820 by 30 (tens place of 737):**\n   - 820 \u00d7 30 = 24,600\n\n3. **Multiply 820 by 700 (hundreds place of 737):**\n   - 820 \u00d7 700 = 574,000\n\n4. **Add all the partial products together:**\n   - 5,740 + 24,600 + 574,000 = 604,340\n\n**Final Answer:**\nThe product of 820 and 737 is **604,340**.\n\n```plaintext\n   820\n\u00d7 737\n------\n   5740   (820 \u00d7 7)\n 24600    (820 \u00d7 30)\n574000    (820 \u00d7 700)\n------\n604340\n```\n\n**Final Answer:** \\boxed{604340}",
