      "index": 0,
      "text": "288,000.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Write the numbers vertically aligned by place value:**\n   \n   ```\n     384\n   \u00d7 750\n   ```\n\n2. **Multiply 384 by 0 (units place of 750):**\n   \n   ```\n     384\n   \u00d7  0\n   ----\n     000\n   ```\n\n3. **Multiply 384 by 50 (tens place of 750):**\n   \n   - Multiply 384 by 5:\n     ```\n     384 \u00d7 5 = 1,920\n     ```\n   - Since it's the tens place, add a zero:\n     ```\n     19,200\n     ```\n\n4. **Multiply 384 by 700 (hundreds place of 750):**\n   \n   - Multiply 384 by 7:\n     ```\n     384 \u00d7 7 = 2,688\n     ```\n   - Since it's the hundreds place, add two zeros:\n     ```\n     268,800\n     ```\n\n5. **Add all the partial products together:**\n   \n   ```\n     000\n   +19,200\n   +268,800\n   ---------\n   288,000\n   ```\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\boxed{288000}",
