      "text": "280,000.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Write the numbers vertically aligned by place value:**\n   \n   ```\n     560\n   \u00d7 500\n   ```\n\n2. **Multiply 560 by 0 (units place of 500):**\n   \n   ```\n     560\n   \u00d7  0\n   ----\n     000\n   ```\n\n3. **Multiply 560 by 0 (tens place of 500), and shift one position to the left:**\n   \n   ```\n     560\n   \u00d7  0\n   ----\n    0000\n   ```\n\n4. **Multiply 560 by 5 (hundreds place of 500), and shift two positions to the left:**\n   \n   ```\n     560\n   \u00d7  5\n   ----\n   280000\n   ```\n\n5. **Add all the partial products together:**\n   \n   ```\n     000\n   +0000\n   +280000\n   ----\n   280000\n   ```\n\n6. **Final Answer:**\n   \n   The product of 560 and 500 is **280,000**.\n\n\\boxed{280000}",
