      "text": "363,693.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 939 by 7 (ones place):**\n   - 9 \u00d7 7 = 63\n   - 3 \u00d7 7 = 21\n   - 9 \u00d7 7 = 63\n   - Write down 63, carry over 6.\n   - 21 + 6 = 27, write down 7, carry over 2.\n   - 63 + 2 = 65\n   - **Partial Product:** 6,573\n\n2. **Multiply 939 by 80 (tens place):**\n   - 9 \u00d7 8 = 72\n   - 3 \u00d7 8 = 24\n   - 9 \u00d7 8 = 72\n   - Write down 72, carry over 7.\n   - 24 + 7 = 31, write down 1, carry over 3.\n   - 72 + 3 = 75\n   - **Partial Product:** 75,120\n\n3. **Multiply 939 by 300 (hundreds place):**\n   - 9 \u00d7 3 = 27\n   - 3 \u00d7 3 = 9\n   - 9 \u00d7 3 = 27\n   - Write down 27, carry over 2.\n   - 9 + 2 = 11, write down 11\n   - **Partial Product:** 281,700\n\n4. **Add all partial products:**\n   - 6,573 + 75,120 = 81,693\n   - 81,693 + 281,700 = 363,393\n\n**Final Answer:** 363,393\n\n\\boxed{363393}",
