      "text": "146,254.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 866 by 9 (ones place):**\n   - 6 \u00d7 9 = 54. Write down 4 and carry over 5.\n   - 6 \u00d7 9 = 54 + 5 (carry) = 59. Write down 9 and carry over 5.\n   - 8 \u00d7 9 = 72 + 5 (carry) = 77.\n   - **Partial Product:** 7,794\n\n2. **Multiply 866 by 60 (tens place):**\n   - 6 \u00d7 6 = 36. Write down 6 and carry over 3.\n   - 6 \u00d7 6 = 36 + 3 (carry) = 39. Write down 9 and carry over 3.\n   - 8 \u00d7 6 = 48 + 3 (carry) = 51.\n   - **Partial Product:** 51,960\n\n3. **Multiply 866 by 100 (hundreds place):**\n   - 866 \u00d7 1 = 866.\n   - **Partial Product:** 86,600\n\n4. **Add all partial products:**\n   - 7,794 + 51,960 = 59,754\n   - 59,754 + 86,600 = 146,254\n\n**Final Answer:**\nThe product of 866 and 169 is \\boxed{146254}.",
