      "text": "195,300.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Write the numbers vertically aligned by place value:**\n   \n   ```\n     930\n   \u00d7 210\n   ```\n\n2. **Multiply 930 by 0 (ones place of 210):**\n   \n   ```\n     930\n   \u00d7  0\n   ----\n     000\n   ```\n\n3. **Multiply 930 by 1 (tens place of 210), shifted one position to the left:**\n   \n   ```\n     930\n   \u00d7  10\n   ----\n    9300\n   ```\n\n4. **Multiply 930 by 2 (hundreds place of 210), shifted two positions to the left:**\n   \n   ```\n     930\n   \u00d7 200\n   ----\n  186000\n   ```\n\n5. **Add all the partial products together:**\n   \n   ```\n     000\n   +9300\n   +186000\n   ----\n   195300\n   ```\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\boxed{195300}",
