      "text": "116,004.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 268 by 3 (ones place):**\n   - 8 \u00d7 3 = 24. Write down 4 and carry over 2.\n   - 6 \u00d7 3 = 18, plus the carried 2 equals 20. Write down 0 and carry over 2.\n   - 2 \u00d7 3 = 6, plus the carried 2 equals 8.\n   - **Partial Product:** 804\n\n2. **Multiply 268 by 30 (tens place):**\n   - 8 \u00d7 3 = 24. Write down 4 and carry over 2.\n   - 6 \u00d7 3 = 18, plus the carried 2 equals 20. Write down 0 and carry over 2.\n   - 2 \u00d7 3 = 6, plus the carried 2 equals 8.\n   - **Partial Product:** 8040\n\n3. **Multiply 268 by 400 (hundreds place):**\n   - 8 \u00d7 4 = 32. Write down 2 and carry over 3.\n   - 6 \u00d7 4 = 24, plus the carried 3 equals 27. Write down 7 and carry over 2.\n   - 2 \u00d7 4 = 8, plus the carried 2 equals 10.\n   - **Partial Product:** 107200\n\n4. **Add all partial products:**\n   - 804 + 8040 = 8844\n   - 8844 + 107200 = 116044\n\n**Final Answer:** 116,044\n\n\\boxed{116044}",
