      "text": "65,771.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 117 by 3 (ones place):**\n   - 117 \u00d7 3 = 351\n\n2. **Multiply 117 by 60 (tens place):**\n   - 117 \u00d7 60 = 7,020\n\n3. **Multiply 117 by 500 (hundreds place):**\n   - 117 \u00d7 500 = 58,500\n\n4. **Add all the partial products together:**\n   - 351 + 7,020 + 58,500 = 65,771\n\n**Final Answer:**\nThe product of 117 and 563 is \\boxed{65771}.",
