      "text": "199,525.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 655 by 5 (ones place):**\n   - 5 \u00d7 5 = 25. Write down 5 and carry over 2.\n   - 5 \u00d7 5 = 25 + 2 = 27. Write down 7 and carry over 2.\n   - 5 \u00d7 6 = 30 + 2 = 32. Write down 32.\n   - **Partial Product:** 3,275\n\n2. **Multiply 655 by 0 (tens place):**\n   - 0 \u00d7 5 = 0\n   - 0 \u00d7 5 = 0\n   - 0 \u00d7 6 = 0\n   - **Partial Product:** 0 (shifted one position to the left)\n\n3. **Multiply 655 by 3 (hundreds place):**\n   - 3 \u00d7 5 = 15. Write down 5 and carry over 1.\n   - 3 \u00d7 5 = 15 + 1 = 16. Write down 6 and carry over 1.\n   - 3 \u00d7 6 = 18 + 1 = 19. Write down 19.\n   - **Partial Product:** 1,965 (shifted two positions to the left)\n\n4. **Add all partial products:**\n   - 3,275\n   - +\u2003\u20030\n   - +196,500\n   - **Total:** 199,525\n\n**Final Answer:** 199,525",
